        "prompt": "Prepare a bounded evaluation of an existing comparison, without starting trials or changing the suite. Use your assignment's own runId as evaluationRunId (the workflow invocation, even when nested). Preserve all input settings.\nRead read_workflow_comparisons action report in bounded sample pages, and action case for captured case guidance and assertions. Wait for comparison trials to finish before starting this workflow. Select at most maxSamples, preferably complete case/repetition pairs from both sides; account for omitted samples with remaining. Retain only roots whose original frozen observation AND current retained run are completed. Use get_run_briefing to check current state; skip missing, failed, cancelled, not_started, stale or unreadable artifacts with a reason. Never replace an original trial with later retry output. Do not expose side, version, worker identity or other scores to graders. Samples need only opaque sample/run/case references, fixed settings, original frozen checks, and bounded case guidance. Copy captured qualityGuidance exactly (or an empty string when absent), without rewriting the criteria. Omit side/version fields; existing guidance and artifacts may still contain identity clues.\nFor checks_only, read get_run_result {id:runId,field:output,path:outputPath,includeHash:true,maxBytes:262144} per selected root and copy its sha256 into evidence. Discard the artifact body after this check. If unavailable or too large, skip with a reason and suggest a narrower outputPath. In review mode do not read the output: return evidence:[] for a separate fresh reviewer. Mirror the fixed settings and evaluationRunId into each sample. Keep skipped at most 100, remaining counts all further omitted samples. Do not claim acceptance or choose a winner. An empty selection is allowed and must explain why in skipped/remaining."
